        "|-----|--------|-------|---------------------|\n",
        "| T4 (Free) | #70 | ~2.5 Gkeys/s | ~3.8 hours for full search |\n",
        "| T4 (Pro) | #70 | ~2.5 Gkeys/s | ~3.8 hours |\n",
        "| V100 | #70 | ~8 Gkeys/s | ~1.2 hours |\n",
        "| A100 | #70 | ~20 Gkeys/s | ~29 minutes |\n",
        "\n",
        "## 🔑 Key Features\n",
        "\n",
        "- **GLV Endomorphism** (ψ orbit, factor √3)\n",
        "- **Negation Symmetry** (factor 2)\n",
        "- **Combined 75% search reduction** (factor ~2.45)\n",
        "- **Auto-checkpoint** every 5 minutes to Google Drive\n",
        "- **Auto-resume** on reconnect\n",
        "- **Sanity test** verifies math before search\n",
        "- **Real-time speed display** (MK/s)\n",
        "\n",
        "## 🛑 Stopping & Resuming\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Ctrl+C** → Graceful stop, checkpoint saved\n",
        "- **Disconnect** → Auto-save every 5 min\n",
        "- **Reconnect** → Run cell 9️⃣ to resume instantly"
      ]
    }
